# GLib from upstream's release, built by its own Meson with one patch
# (glib-dolly.patch: g_unix_fd_query_path is not supported here, as on Hurd).
# A program that links GLib is threaded, calls through libffi (dso@0's FFI)
# and calls functions through pointers cast to types of other parameters,
# which traps in WebAssembly: GObject's pkg-config file asks cc for
# --dolly-cast-emulation (Binaryen's wasm-opt --fpcast-emu after the link),
# and this package's own programs are passed through it here.
FROM /v0.1.3/demos/tools/Dollyfile-tools-build 9ba7f8fbe7c465254861c1f2356bd1e7357599bf0e1f9e1089fc2a7958c241a3
INSTALL /v0.1.3/demos/tools/Dollyfile-meson b442eac6c3a7f687bd30f1eb218eec0f9240218da3e7c45818c8348af6a123e3
INSTALL /v0.1.3/demos/zero-ad/Dollyfile-pkgconf 8e7825d1009a2fff6dba7ff4458734a622ffcaf65e4627e6576c2a512d9dccab
INSTALL /v0.1.3/demos/tools/Dollyfile-xz 0f40f527360a03c47e6795e707e8ea1e1fcf7fae48f4e078c75b4a891014df9e
INSTALL /v0.1.3/demos/tools/Dollyfile-tar 94cddb08097cd7da025a0e4f90e5b22487477394d203b63ed683f79c9e6b4ca7
INSTALL /v0.1.3/demos/tools/Dollyfile-binaryen b6d5807a9b940d47cd792bd43b3a7737265c7c781804b367ae00fc4eedc72b62
INSTALL /v0.1.3/demos/python/Dollyfile-libffi 6344d67e0b4f5c882fe39af36c99d5b976e391309ea80dc3d863cb94c0bc76b6
